{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wondered what position the game you own occupies among all Steam players? Have you ever wondered what the highest level among Steam players is? Have you ever wondered who was the first player to unlock achievements on Steam? Now DAO is here, and DAO is far more than that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAO is a real-time ranking of Steam players, letting Steam players know everything about themselves through various leaderboards. DAO also has beautiful fades, animations and themes, and you can even customize the interface with everything you imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAO enabled high definition also supports NVIDIA Deep Learning Super Sampling (DLSS) and AMD FidelityFX Super Resolution (FSR) technology, and it doesn't matter in case your computer doesn't support either of these, we also have our own dynamic resolution technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DAO listens to the hearts and minds of all players, and players can tell us in the community about any ranked categories you desire, as well as all the themes and colors you wish, and we'll make updates and launch them as soon as we can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Leaderboards</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games Value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Unlocked Achievement Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocked Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paid Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recent Playtime</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recent Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friends Level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games Real Time Value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Games Discount</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Last Unlocked Achievement Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free Games</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Available Themes and Custom Colors</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matrix</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black Pink</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hollywood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renaissance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >White</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gray</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orange</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yellow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chartreuse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Green</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mint Green</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyan</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sky Blue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purple</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magenta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rose Red</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3577840?t=1772359625","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577840/3aa354e86ed31e7704d338cbadce4895782e4204/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772359625","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577840/9a768577a55594f2f21e693ae592d0efedcf0ca7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772359625","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577840/9a768577a55594f2f21e693ae592d0efedcf0ca7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772359625","categories":[{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"S